!!! oculus/window/record.mat
!!! The core window record.
!!!
!!! A window carries everything the session manager needs: identity,
!!! lifecycle state, position/size, workspace assignment, z-order,
!!! focus state, and a human-readable label.

book oculus.window.record

read everything from ny.lang.core
read everything from oculus.window.geometry
read everything from oculus.window.lifecycle
read everything from oculus.window.workspace

public window begin record
    field identity as override long
    field state as window-state
    field geometry as rectangle
    field workspace as workspace
    field z-index as override long
    field focused as boolean
    field label as text
end record
